Package: libxkbcommon0
Version: @DEB_LIBXKBCOMMON_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: xkeyboard-config, libxml2, libxcb1, libxcb-xkb1
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://xkbcommon.org
Description: Library to handle keyboard descriptions (XKB)
 libxkbcommon is a keymap compiler and support library which processes a
 reduced subset of keymaps as defined by the XKB specification. Used by the
 Wayland compositor to compile keymaps for wl_keyboard. This package contains
 the shared libraries, including libxkbcommon-x11 for Xwayland-backed clients;
 keymap data comes from xkeyboard-config.
